; Direct signed-arithmetic port of Mathlib/NumberTheory/FLT/Three.lean:68-76.
; Formal differences give a quotient-free concrete model of the source integers.
; Every equivalence and divisibility transfer is proved explicitly; no admission.
; This first case still leaves the cyclotomic descent needed for exponent three.
